WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.579
Coach Biggs, the Miners' coach, stomped onto the field.

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.384
The Loggers' coach ran onto the field too.

3
00:00:06.385 --> 00:00:09.513
"Let my players go, Hitz!" Coach Biggs said.

4
00:00:09.514 --> 00:00:13.737
"And then get out of here! You're a cheater and a bad sport!"

5
00:00:13.738 --> 00:00:17.931
Fitz Hitz puffed out his chest. "I'm a winner!"

6
00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:21.373
"I have to arrest Fitz Hitz!" Roxy thought.

7
00:00:21.374 --> 00:00:23.670
She started to fly down.

8
00:00:23.671 --> 00:00:30.704
But then she heard fans yelling at Coach Biggs.

9
00:00:30.705 --> 00:00:34.439
"Let Hitz play, Coach!" a fan shouted.

10
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.075
She wore a Miners baseball cap.

11
00:00:37.076 --> 00:00:39.309
"Yeah!" Another fan said.

12
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.983
His face was painted with the Miners' colors.

13
00:00:41.984 --> 00:00:44.782
"You shouldn't have kicked Hitz off the team!"

14
00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:52.050
Fans chanted. "Let Hitz play! Let Hitz play!"

15
00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.581
Coach Biggs threw his hands in the air.

16
00:00:54.582 --> 00:00:58.832
"Fine!" He stomped off the field.

17
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:00.963
The Loggers' coach shrugged.

18
00:01:00.964 --> 00:01:03.990
"You want to finish the game with just one player?

19
00:01:03.991 --> 00:01:07.851
Fine! We're already winning anyway."

20
00:01:07.852 --> 00:01:10.203
Hitz stepped up to the plate.

21
00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:13.061
Sparks shot from his Blast Bat.

22
00:01:13.062 --> 00:01:15.898
The Loggers' pitcher threw the ball.

23
00:01:15.899 --> 00:01:16.939
Hitz swung.

24
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:24.082
Crack—pow! The ball shot through the air like a meteor.

25
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.370
Roxy's eyes went wide.

26
00:01:26.371 --> 00:01:29.048
"That's a powerful bat!"

27
00:01:29.049 --> 00:01:32.561
"Home run!" the announcer said.

28
00:01:32.562 --> 00:01:37.419
"Yeah! A home run for me!"

29
00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:42.155
Hitz cheered for himself as he ran around the bases.

30
00:01:42.156 --> 00:01:46.363
He stepped up to the plate again.

31
00:01:46.364 --> 00:01:50.417
Crack—pow! The ball smashed a big screen.

32
00:01:50.418 --> 00:01:55.742
Roxy gasped. But the crowd cheered.

33
00:01:55.743 --> 00:02:00.181
"Another home run for the Miners!" the announcer said.

34
00:02:00.182 --> 00:02:03.824
Crack—pow! Hitz hit the ball again.

35
00:02:03.825 --> 00:02:06.128
It shot into the stands and broke a beam.

36
00:02:06.129 --> 00:02:09.783
An entire section of seats began to fall.

37
00:02:09.784 --> 00:02:14.321
Fans screamed.

38
00:02:14.322 --> 00:02:18.055
"Uh-oh!" Roxy thought.

39
00:02:18.056 --> 00:02:21.145
Her friends were under the broken section!

40
00:02:21.146 --> 00:02:23.912
"We'll be crushed!" Mara cried.

41
00:02:23.913 --> 00:02:29.259
Roxy flew fast.

42
00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:33.472
She got under the broken section and lifted it back up.

43
00:02:33.473 --> 00:02:38.514
She used her heat vision to fix the beam.

44
00:02:38.515 --> 00:02:44.945
The crowd cheered.

45
00:02:44.946 --> 00:02:48.390
Terrell grinned. "Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

46
00:02:48.391 --> 00:02:51.550
"No problem!" Roxy smiled.

47
00:02:51.551 --> 00:02:54.657
Then she flew over the field.

48
00:02:54.658 --> 00:02:59.193
"Game over, Fitz! You're under arrest!"

49
00:02:59.194 --> 00:03:01.817
Fitz Hitz had an evil look in his eye.

50
00:03:01.818 --> 00:03:05.140
"I don't think so, Rocket Girl."

51
00:03:05.141 --> 00:03:07.608
He picked up a ball.

52
00:03:07.609 --> 00:03:11.139
Crack—pow! It shot toward Roxy.

53
00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:15.125
"Whoa!" Roxy barely got out of the way in time.

54
00:03:15.126 --> 00:03:17.143
A jet was flying by.

55
00:03:17.144 --> 00:03:20.607
The ball broke one of its wings.

56
00:03:20.608 --> 00:03:25.989
The crowd gasped as the jet spun downward.

57
00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:32.296
Fitz Hitz shrugged. "Another home run for me!"

